#: src/app/[lang]/features/tag-analytics/page.tsx
msgid "Categories answer \"what kind of expense\"; tags answer \"for what purpose\". Both views live in Analytics — switch between them with one tap. Categories give a structured budget view; tags give project-level and context-level views."
