#: src/app/[lang]/features/account-management/page.tsx
msgid "Deleting is permanent and only available for archived accounts: the account and its transactions are gone for good, and there is no option to move them elsewhere first. Transfers with other accounts stay there as “Transfer (account deleted)”. Archiving is the safer choice — it hides the account from the home but keeps the data."
