#: src/app/[lang]/blog/local-first-movement-developers/page.tsx
msgid "Despite the complexity of distributed systems concepts, local-first development can be simpler than cloud-first. You build an application that works on a single device first. Then you add sync on top. The core logic is straightforward application development without the complexity of distributed systems."
