msgid "Install Budgie, open Settings and tap Import Database in the Data Management list. Pick the backup file and confirm the warning. If the backup is PIN-locked, Budgie asks for the PIN it was made with and keeps it as the lock on the restored data; a backup made without a PIN restores with no PIN set. Backups made by an older version of Budgie cannot be restored."
